We have a problem. The tentacle is very tough, and its self-defense is instant. Not even the Royal Mages' flame could burn it. We need a more powerful flame.
Being a god's creation, the Insane Witch holds ancestral power in her flames. They are our only chance.
Midranda has finally begun his final attack.

Here, take the Magic Censer and absorb the Insane Witch's Ancestral Flame. We need to help our companions.

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt 30 Insane Witches in the Sanctuary of the Abyss.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
